    "agent_last_message": "Implemented complete solution at [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js).\n\nWhat it does:\n- Supports only `--input <path>` and `--output <path>` (unknown/missing/duplicate args => exit `1`).\n- Reads and analyzes the input file using only Node.js standard library.\n- Computes:\n  - `lines` (per spec, including no-trailing-newline behavior)\n  - `words` (split on exactly: space, `\\t`, `\\n`, `\\r`, `\\f`, `\\v`)\n  - `characters` (byte count)\n  - `unique_words` (case-insensitive)\n  - `top_words` (up to 10, sorted by count desc then lexicographic asc)\n- Treats unreadable/missing input and malformed UTF-8 as invalid invocation (exit `1`).\n- Uses exit `2` for unexpected internal errors.\n- Writes JSON output in the required schema.\n\nRun:\n- From `/workspace/output`: `node main.js --input <file> --output <file>`\n- Or from `/workspace`: `node output/main.js --input <file> --output <file>`\n\nValidation executed:\n- Syntax check passed (`node --check`).\n- Spec edge cases passed (empty file, no trailing newline, trailing newline, consecutive newlines, case-insensitive frequencies, punctuation behavior, malformed input exit code, invalid invocation exit code).",
